WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
This is the Industrial Capital Project Recovery war room. It is where a slipping project gets a plan. What follows is a simulated incident.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Late switchgear has pushed the critical path of a plant expansion back by six weeks. The operator loads the schedule-slip report.

3
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Six engines work the report. Phase Two completion moves from March to May, and two commissioning milestones are at risk. Exposure runs from nine hundred thousand to one point seven million dollars. The risk score is sixty-eight out of one hundred.

4
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:55.000
One click sends the case to the Operations Strategist, which shows what the exposure becomes with action, and without it.

5
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:10.000
The Executive Portal presents the decision: approve the resequencing of the civil and electrical packages within two days, for sixty thousand dollars. The system recommends. The project director decides.

